{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09627","headline":"题华严寺瓌公禅房 · 岑参","name":"题华严寺瓌公禅房","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"寺南几十峰，峰翠晴可掬。\n朝从老僧饭，昨日崖口宿。\n锡杖倚枯松，绳牀暎深竹。\n东谿草堂路，来往行自熟。\n生事在云山，谁能复羁束。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"岑参","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09627.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09627","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}